      "input": "SI software (Cursor, Grok, apps) + advertising",
      "value": "Q3: advertising $538M; Cursor $608M for ~1.5 months (implies ~$1.2B quarterly run-rate). Q4 software $1.8B + ads $550M (estimate: full-quarter Cursor plus Grok). Then mid-teens sequential growth \u2014 not disclosed beyond Q3.",
      "kind": "estimate after Q3",
      "source": "Q3 2026 earnings release / call (Cursor $608M, ads $538M, Grok Bot 800k paid weekly users)",
